## Platform Support
The software has been tested on various platforms including:
- Linux (x86, AMD64, Alpha, Itanium, s390x, PowerPC)
- Unix systems (Solaris, AIX, HP-UX)
- BSD systems (FreeBSD, NetBSD)
- macOS
- Windows (via Cygwin)
